I am at the office.
I call the hair salon.
The hairdresser answers.
"Hello, this is Maya Flores," I say.
"I have an appointment on Wednesday at six o'clock."
"I am sorry, but I do not have time."
"I need a new appointment."
"That is no problem, Frau Flores," the hairdresser says.
"Do you have time on Thursday?"
I look at my calendar.
I always go to the gym on Thursdays.
The workout starts at half past five.
"Do you have an open appointment in the evening?" I ask.
"Does half past seven work?" she asks.
I am glad.
"Yes, at half past seven is great," I say.
That fits very well.
"Thank you very much and see you Thursday!"
"See you Thursday, Frau Flores," she answers.
